voidfabricator.tooltip.pattern.install=Install: insert a GT machine first, then right-click with this pattern to bind it, or place it in the panel's pattern slot.
voidfabricator.tooltip.pattern.retrieve=Retrieve: eject the pattern in the panel, then the machine. The machine cannot be ejected while the pattern remains.
voidfabricator.tooltip.pattern.binding=Binding identity: machine registry name, item metadata, and implementation class.
